From 01c44beec1901e80fb6ba89d9cdf578050410666 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:49:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] generate: the solo pipeline refuses DFlash2, whose slot
 drafts turn --batch-mtp on later (STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE, fixup of fed5a555)

The "not with --batch-mtp" gate read only o.batch_mtp and STRATA_BATCH_MTP,
but v0.2.12's batch_df2_wanted sets batch_mtp after it (--draft dflash2
--draft-fallback mtp with --batch on one slot group), so solo_pl stayed on
beside the slots' drafters.  Refused for --draft dflash2 as the lanes do
(lanes_upstream_off).  Production has no DFlash2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/program/generate.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/program/generate.cpp b/src/program/generate.cpp
index 4e138a97..fea9e9f1 100644
--- a/src/program/generate.cpp
+++ b/src/program/generate.cpp
@@ -6184,6 +6184,9 @@ int main(int argc, char** argv) {
                         : solo_pl_asked && (o.batch_mtp || [] { const char* v = std::getenv("STRATA_BATCH_MTP");
                                                                 return v != nullptr && v[0] != '\0' && v[0] != '0'; }())
                             ? "STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE: not with --batch-mtp"
+                        // (v0.2.12's DFlash2 slot drafts turn --batch-mtp on later, batch_df2_wanted; as the lanes refuse it)
+                        : solo_pl_asked && o.draft == "dflash2"
+                            ? "STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE: not with DFlash2 (--draft dflash2 / auto: its slot drafts are --batch-mtp's)"
                         : o.peer_device >= 1 ? "not with --peer-device"
                         : helpers ? "not with the helper caches (--expert-cache-device1..3, --remote-expert-opt)"
                         : nullptr;
